{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4042faf4ab51350e0eada64c53ee04be87ccb41d0a31efc8589430b5d8ddb566", "ja": "（中央エリアを巡るLOVERS HEART公演も\nいよいよ大詰め。そろそろリハーサルだが……）", "zh": "（围绕中央区域的LOVERS HEART公演终于接近尾声。差不多该彩排了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "8916ea1bd311febbc2a49cf4c55f15710ff77b57e3421e08bd011255736681b9", "ja": "なになに？　……新人の登竜門とも言われるこの会場で\n昨夜恒例のライブが行われ……。へえ、面白そうだな。", "zh": "什么什么？……据说这里是新人出道的登龙门，昨晚还举办了惯例演出……哦，听起来挺有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ea1b5d41aed11fe9ec078b436f05a2c7f44331db0d640df9c8b7019512875279", "ja": "お疲れ様、ジュリア。何してるんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，茱莉亚。你在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "2d7902485e79155b2d889d2a3586de3173c6f3c5bd8762abf55a15a6a0990119", "ja": "なんだ、だらPか。\nあたしは今、MC用に中央エリアの予習中だ。", "zh": "什么啊，原来是懒P。\n我现在正在为MC预习中央区域。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1004_p", "source_sha256": "17e396340648ce83381f0b789ecb69bbfdda69e9837809e93044b4821cd3e3ad", "ja": "だら？　……ってなんだ？", "zh": "“邋遢”？……那是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "cde7658bd461f828e3df7651c271264d51b7f2df2a7058b61a6702ad1a4a2890", "ja": "やっぱ通じないか……。\n『だら』ってのは、『バカ』って意味らしい。", "zh": "果然听不懂吗……\n“だら”好像是“笨蛋”的意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "1e27de9df1914d42535bbee1b7112efd85664b6eacd054e40d3b5c5586dcf5d1", "ja": "ムギから北陸の言葉を少し教わってきたんだけど……\n使い方が合ってないっぽいな。", "zh": "我向小紬学了几句北陆方言……\n看来用法好像不太对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c5cc1b71ccd36495a2975152f46a9a63570f654aee55f96b3fd4d608c1d9e16d", "ja": "ああ、方言だったのか……\nそういえば、前に紬が言っていたような気もするな。", "zh": "啊，原来是方言啊……\n这么一说，我好像记得紬以前也说过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "6fe75445ee93861ad58c71c1075638ac8b043ee39522451658bfa0bed36afea5", "ja": "いや、言われたことあるのかよ。\n……まあその、なんだ。今回は地方公演だからな。", "zh": "不是，你还真被她说过啊。\n……呃，怎么说呢。毕竟这次是地方巡演嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "58dbdc73c4cb4d0675fb0decbc5fba6e282d263296f503c40efd39433b559b66", "ja": "あたしも地方出身だし、ファンの気持ちが\nちょっとはわかるっていうか……。", "zh": "我也是地方出身的，所以也算能稍微理解粉丝的心情吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "7d56436001162e7f591a1b1aa0c8413ac92184fc8ee9fd7ee254670f07fa398f", "ja": "好きなアーティストが、地元の事を\n話題にしてくれるのって、案外うれしいものなんだよ。", "zh": "喜欢的艺人要是能聊到自己的家乡，\n其实会让人意外地开心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8429aba05c22996feb64ced8a52f03ffefc8074493d7fd0b26028d8428387bec", "ja": "なるほど、それで地元の新聞を読んで研究してたのか。\n流石ジュリアだな。", "zh": "原来如此，所以你才会读当地的报纸做调查啊。不愧是茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "fea11f036aaf2eee7d4af596dc655da598dc5b3378e5f023c4934d4dee095a14", "ja": "ま、昔の仲間の受け売りなんだけどな。ロックも\nアイドルも、ファンの気持ちは同じだろうからさ。", "zh": "不过，这也只是在现学现卖以前同伴的话罢了。\n毕竟无论是摇滚还是偶像，粉丝的心情应该都是相通的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "bf7e1c40e93799204081211943e1b2b3c7f495deab211ef825ef49c64e3a4536", "ja": "とにかく、あたしは忙しいんだ。\nわかったら、邪魔しないでくれるか？", "zh": "总之，我很忙。\n明白的话，就别来妨碍我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1014_p", "source_sha256": "511bff915fcb9b7085746ac5392d75b3050fb1a7963511031424dcc6a4d1153d", "ja": "ああ、悪かった。\n手伝わなくて大丈夫か？", "zh": "啊，抱歉。\n不用我帮忙也没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "91a7f8551a5644003e891dc8610f5b0f8df251c8c33e255a635034e1551e49a3", "ja": "え？　……ああ、そうだな。じゃああんたは、中央\nエリアで流行ってる、美味しいモノを探してきてくれ。", "zh": "诶？……啊，也是。那你就去中央区域找找最近流行的美食吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b044a8b1151ec970d7b779889019b45250f454533290dee27cd24fbd41e6bb12", "ja": "美味しいもの……でいいのか？", "zh": "好吃的东西……这样就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "4353a53fe9e37772ea3b4076aad9c1a6dd483a6c634d2b9f2bccb102a8a562c5", "ja": "ああ。地元のファンとは共通の話題になるし、\nウチらは美味しいものが食べられる……。", "zh": "啊。既能和当地的粉丝找到共同话题，\n我们也能吃到美味的东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0313_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "890e1b16037af6ee751d7c59829cad2c8956d7324ef0cd308cf571a16072dabb", "ja": "まさに一石二鳥、ってやつだろ？\n頼んだぜ、{$P$}♪", "zh": "这就叫一石二鸟吧？\n就拜托你了，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
